  {
   "id": "sec1-1",
   "section": "Osama Siblani",
   "text": "Siblani received the “Spirit of Diversity in Journalism” award from Wayne State University in the 10th Annual Helen Thomas Awards on April 16, 2010.",
   "words": 24,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2",
